error[E0277]: `#[config(bounds = …)]` reads a `Duration`, an `Option<Duration>`, a `usize`, a `u32` or an `Option<usize>`, not `u64`
  --> tests/integration/diagnostics/config/config_bounds_on_a_type_no_range_holds.rs:16:13
   |
16 |     window: u64,
   |             ^^^ a field its bounds read
   |
   = help: the trait `BoundedField` is not implemented for `u64`
   = note: a duration is a `Duration`, or an `Option<Duration>` where `None` turns it off; a count is a `usize` or a `u32`, or an `Option<usize>` where `None` is no limit
